- flows/show-script (irreversible): Return the source of every cell this turn has executed, plus the house rules and the file template a saved flow uses. Call it before flows/write-flow.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"bestPractices":{"type":"string","description":"Extra guidance to append after the house rules"}},"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- flows/write-flow (irreversible) capabilities=fs:write:/flows/**: Save a flow: writes flow.ts, flow.e2e.ts, and its fixture under flows/<id>/. The id must be lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Flow id and directory name; lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens, starting with a letter"},"description":{"type":"string","description":"One line the flow list shows"},"flowSource":{"type":"string","description":"Complete flow.ts source"},"testSource":{"type":"string","description":"Complete flow.e2e.ts source, using cachedModelTest"},"fixtureJson":{"type":"string","description":"Recorded model fixture as JSON text"}},"required":["id","description","flowSource","testSource","fixtureJson"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- tevm/call (irreversible) capabilities=net:post:*: Execute raw calldata against the fork without mining it. Reports gas used and, when the call reverts, the revert reason.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"to":{"type":"string","description":"20-byte account address, 0x-prefixed and hex encoded"},"data":{"type":"string","description":"0x-prefixed hex string"},"from":{"type":"string","description":"20-byte account address, 0x-prefixed and hex encoded"},"value":{"type":"string","description":"Amount in wei as a decimal string; a 256-bit value does not fit in a JSON number"},"blockTag":{"type":"string","description":"Block number as a decimal string, or one of latest, pending, safe, finalized, earliest"}},"required":["to","data"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- tevm/fork (irreversible) capabilities=net:post:*: Fork a chain into an in-memory EVM at a block. Call this once before any other tevm flow; every later call reads the forked state.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"rpcUrl":{"type":"string","description":"JSON-RPC endpoint the fork reads state from"},"blockTag":{"type":"string","description":"Block number as a decimal string, or one of latest, pending, safe, finalized, earliest"}},"required":["rpcUrl"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- tevm/getBalance (irreversible) capabilities=net:post:*: Native token balance of an address on the fork. Returns wei as a decimal string plus an ether rendering.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"address":{"type":"string","description":"20-byte account address, 0x-prefixed and hex encoded"},"blockTag":{"type":"string","description":"Block number as a decimal string, or one of latest, pending, safe, finalized, earliest"}},"required":["address"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- tevm/getBlock (irreversible) capabilities=net:post:*: Header fields of one block on the fork: number, hashes, timestamp, gas, and base fee.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"blockTag":{"type":"string","description":"Block number as a decimal string, or one of latest, pending, safe, finalized, earliest"}},"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- tevm/mine (irreversible): Mine pending transactions into new blocks on the fork and return the block numbers produced.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"blocks":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/Union_"}]},"intervalSeconds":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/Union_"}]}},"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{"Union_":{"type":"string","enum":["Infinity","-Infinity","NaN"]}}}
- tevm/readContract (irreversible) capabilities=net:post:*: Call a view or pure contract function on the fork and decode the result. Pass human-readable ABI signatures, not a JSON ABI.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"address":{"type":"string","description":"20-byte account address, 0x-prefixed and hex encoded"},"abi":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Human-readable ABI signatures, for example [\"function balanceOf(address) view returns (uint256)\"]"},"functionName":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the function to read"},"args":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Arguments as strings: addresses as hex, integers as decimal strings"},"blockTag":{"type":"string","description":"Block number as a decimal string, or one of latest, pending, safe, finalized, earliest"}},"required":["address","abi","functionName"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- tevm/setAccount (irreversible): Overwrite an account's balance, nonce, or code on the fork. Use it to fund an address before a simulation.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"address":{"type":"string","description":"20-byte account address, 0x-prefixed and hex encoded"},"balance":{"type":"string","description":"Amount in wei as a decimal string; a 256-bit value does not fit in a JSON number"},"nonce":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"string","enum":["Infinity","-Infinity","NaN"]}]},"code":{"type":"string","description":"0x-prefixed hex string"}},"required":["address"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- tevm/simulate (irreversible) capabilities=net:post:*: Run a sequence of calls against the same pending state and report each result plus the balance changes they cause. Nothing is committed.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"calls":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"to":{"type":"string","description":"20-byte account address, 0x-prefixed and hex encoded"},"data":{"type":"string","description":"0x-prefixed hex string"},"from":{"type":"string","description":"20-byte account address, 0x-prefixed and hex encoded"},"value":{"type":"string","description":"Amount in wei as a decimal string; a 256-bit value does not fit in a JSON number"}},"required":["to","data"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"Calls applied in order against the same pending state"}},"required":["calls"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- ui/html (irreversible): Render an HTML fragment as a card in the transcript. Use it only when no registered pane fits; a pane is always the better answer.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"html":{"type":"string","description":"HTML fragment; the shell renders it in a scriptless sandboxed frame with no network"},"title":{"type":"string","description":"Card heading"}},"required":["html"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}
- ui/pane (irreversible): Render a registered pane as a card in the transcript. Prefer this over prose whenever a pane fits the data; a wrong name is refused with the list of registered panes.
  input: {"dialect":"draft-2020-12","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Registered pane name, as listed in the failure message when wrong"},"props":{},"title":{"type":"string","description":"Card heading; the pane's own title is used when omitted"}},"required":["name","props"],"additionalProperties":false},"definitions":{}}

## Required output shape

When you return `{ intent: "complete", ... }`, the `output` field must be a
string holding exactly ONE JSON document that validates against this JSON
Schema. No prose, no explanation, and no code fence around it.

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The app's name, slug-safe"
    },
    "summary": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "One paragraph: what was built and what it does"
    },
    "files": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "App-root relative path"
          },
          "purpose": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "One line: what this file is for"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path",
          "purpose"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "steps": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Stage name: describe, plan, generate, validate, fix, smoke, or ship"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "running",
              "done",
              "failed",
              "cached"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name",
          "status"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "shipUrl": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Deployed URL; present only after the ship stage was approved and ran"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "name",
    "summary",
    "files",
    "steps"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

